# Variation 1: 25C, P_total=16, Calcite+Gypsum, pH charge
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
    pH 7 charge
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 10
    Gypsum 0 10
    CO2(g) 0 10
    CH4(g) 0.69897 10
    H2S(g) 1.0 10
END

